{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>לדמשק</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: והגליתי אתכם מהלאה לדמשק (and I will exile you beyond Damascus). Because of the sin they committed in Damascus they were exiled — this is the obligation of that which is on the left of Damascus."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:06.416974770Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}